  tips:
  - 'Tip: Reducing the game quality on Battle Island will lower the terrain collision
    accuracy.'
  - 'Tip: The Firefox webbrowser runs this game 20% - 30% faster than other browsers
    on laptops.'
  - 'Tip: You can change your crosshair style in the pause menu (press [p] or [esc]
    in the game).'
  - 'Tip: You can play your own background music by not loading the default game music
    in the preloader.'
  - 'Tip: Chat commands such as evicting players are available under the in-game chat
    window.'
  - 'Tip: Double-tapping space locks the hover mode which allows you to concentrate
    on aiming.'
  - 'Tip: Get six kills without dying to launch a bot attack.'
  - 'Tip: Freeplay mode awards you no credits but allows you to explore or race without
    a timelimit.'
  - 'Tip: Being on a team that has less players will give you a double credit bonus.'
  - 'Tip: Submitting valid bug reports will get you a free 400 credits.'
  - 'Tip: You can minimize the chat window at any time by clicking the [x] button
    in the corner.'
  - 'Tip: It is not possible to kill someone who is idle (except by pushing them out
    of the map boundaries).'
